@TaskManagerApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5164

### Get All Tasks
GET {{TaskManagerApi_HostAddress}}/api/Tasks
Accept: application/json

###

### Create New Task
POST {{TaskManagerApi_HostAddress}}/api/Tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Test Task from HTTP File",
  "description": "Testing Web API endpoints",
  "isCompleted": false,
  "priority": 2,
  "category": "Work",
  "dueDate": "2026-10-15T10:00:00Z"
}

###

### Update Task by ID
PUT {{TaskManagerApi_HostAddress}}/api/Tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "title": "Updated Task Title",
  "description": "Updated description",
  "isCompleted": true,
  "priority": 1,
  "category": "Work",
  "dueDate": "2026-10-15T12:00:00Z"
}

###

### Delete Task by ID
DELETE {{TaskManagerApi_HostAddress}}/api/Tasks/1

###
